                    "Line 1 is “last connection” with the method's name, for example “Last connection: WireGuard”. Line 2 is the name of the config you connected to. Line 3 shows the live download and upload speeds (↑ and ↓) and that method's ping; when no ping or speed has been measured, nothing is shown — never a made-up number."),
                Block("دکمه دایره‌ای", "The circular button",
