                    "In 2.92 this section is really right-to-left: in Persian the first tab (“All configs”) is on the right and tabs scroll right to left; each config's name and address start from the right; the + menu, the ⋮ menu, the add forms and the dialogs start from the right too. Picking apps for “Per-app settings” no longer opens slowly either: the app list is read in the background and the window opens at once."),
                Block("تازه در ۲٫۹۳", "New in 2.93",
